\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2914973 AURA demonstrates that a robust, modern, and highly functional e-commerce platform can be successfully built using only standard web technologies \emdash  PHP, MySQL, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript \emdash 
 without relying on external heavy frameworks or third-party platforms.
\par The central challenge of the project was designing a co
hesive system architecture that seamlessly balances complex relational data management with secure web practices. Implementing multi-table data relations for product variations (colors, sizes, and stock), managing dynamic shopping cart states via user ses
sions, and providing a secured, unified administrative interface for real-time order lifecycle tracking and media uploads were all achieved while maintaining a clean, minimalist user experience.
\par The result is a comprehensive full-stack application that applies production-level web development principles \emdash 
 including strict role-based access control (RBAC), secure password hashing, prepared database statements, and defensive data sanitization. It stands as a practical, scalable, and well-structured project th
at effectively translates theoretical full-stack development into a real-world commercial solution.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2914973\charrsid2914973 
